# Licensing

Generative Software Engineering (GSE) uses two open licenses according to artifact type.

## Apache License 2.0

Software, executable configuration, and agent-skill artifacts in this repository are licensed under the Apache License 2.0 unless a file states otherwise.

The full license text is in [`LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`](LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt).

## Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International

Methodology prose, documentation, research material, templates, diagrams, and examples in this repository are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0) unless a file states otherwise.

The full legal code is in [`LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt`](LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt).

When reusing CC BY 4.0 material, attribute **Longbiao CHEN** and link to the canonical GSE repository:

https://github.com/longbiaochen/generative-software-engineering
